			dependencies: ["4371A7827F334251"]
			description: [
				"利用图腾魔法，可以扭曲并腐化周围的自然环境。&r（Your natural surroundings can be distorted and corrupted using totem magic.&r）"
				""
				"在底部放置图腾基座，再在上方堆叠五个符文原木，构成图腾。&r（Build a totem with a Totem Base at the bottom and 5 runic logs on top.&r）"
				"进行仪式需要将五份奥术精魂放在图腾上。&r（Five Arcane Spirts will need to go on the totem to perform the ritual.&r）"
				""
				"手持图腾法杖右键点击图腾基座，即可开始仪式。灵魂木生长体有较高概率出现，但仍可能失败。使用骨粉可以加快生长。&r（To start the Ritual, simply Right-click the totem base with the Totemic Staff. Soulwood Growth has a high chance to spawn but is not guaranteed. Bonemeal can be used to make it grow faster.&r）"
				""
				"{image:kubejs:textures/questbook/book_images/totem_magic.png width:208 height:140 align:center}"
