		{
			dependencies: ["65865592B7FBB1CC"]
			description: [
				"利用风暴群岛中的祭坛，可以借助当地天气的能量强化特定物品。&r（Using the shrine in the Storm Islands, you can harness the power of the local weather to empower certain items.&r）"
				""
				"请按下方图片，在祭坛顶部建造一座小型避雷针结构。&r（A small lightning rod structure should be constructed on top as depicted in the image below.&r）"
				""
				""
				"{image:kubejs:textures/questbook/book_images/lightning_shrine.png width:190 height:108 align:center}"
				""
				"将需要转化的物品放在结构下部的基座上。&r（The item that you want to transform should be placed on the pedestal located at the lower part of the structure. &r）"
				""
				"&l只有避雷针中的蓄电器完全充满电，按下结构底部的按钮才会启动转化。&r&r（&lThe button at the base of the structure will only start the conversion if the accumulator in the lightning rod is fully charged.&r&r）"
