			description: [
				"避雷针多方块结构经过了一些改进。&r（The Lightning Rod multiblock has been slightly improved.&r）"
				""
				"现在，由闪电弹等来源产生的人工闪电击中任意钢栅栏，也能产生电力。&r（It now also generates power when artificial lightnig like from a lightning charge hits one of the steel fences.&r）"
				""
				"&l闪电祭坛可以将铜粉转化为闪电弹。&r&r（&lThe Lightning Shrine can convert Copper Dust into a Lightning Charge.&r&r）"
				""
				"这种方式需要先消耗电力来发电。根据避雷针电力输出的速度，每次雷击应能带来约 200,000 RF 的净收益。&r（Using this method you will need power to make power. But each lightning strike should yeild a net positive of ~200.000 RF depending on how fast you can drain the Lighting Rod.&r）"
